# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# AetherGrid AI — Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# STEP 1: Copy this file → .env (local) or paste into Vercel
# STEP 2: Fill in the values below (see GUIDE.md for help)
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── Database (Neon PostgreSQL) ──────────────────────────────
# Free at: https://neon.tech → New Project → copy both URLs
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:pass@ep-xxx.us-east-1.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require"
DIRECT_URL="postgresql://user:pass@ep-xxx.us-east-1.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require"

# ─── NextAuth.js ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generate secret: openssl rand -base64 32  (or use https://generate-secret.vercel.app/32)
NEXTAUTH_SECRET="CHANGE_ME_generate_with_openssl_rand_base64_32"
# Local dev only — Vercel auto-injects NEXTAUTH_URL in production
NEXTAUTH_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# ─── Optional: GitHub OAuth ──────────────────────────────────
# https://github.com/settings/applications/new
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=""
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=""

# ─── Optional: Google OAuth ──────────────────────────────────
# https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=""
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=""
